// selected and written here, never transcribed from the book. Ids are
// 'lex-l{n}:{term}', a new id scheme that never collides with deck/freq/grammar
// stars. Together with the lesson-tagged frequency vocabulary (lessonmap.ts)
// these fill each Lektion's semantic fields.
